  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">North Kordfan Integrated Livelihood Support Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to improve food security, incomes and resilience to shocks of smallholder producers (men, women and youth) in rain-fed areas of North Kordofan state affected by conflict and natural disasters.

The project will:
 
&#x2022;	improve the agricultural productivity of 70 households through the provision of seeds, tools and tractors, and training on good agricultural practice; 
&#x2022;	train 300 women and men in savings and lending, entrepreneurial and business planning skills;
&#x2022;	improve market access and competitiveness of sesame through value chain addition generating activities for 15 men and women;
&#x2022;	improve access to clean drinking water for 70 households through the provision of storage facilities and training in water management.</narrative>
  </description>
